  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-are-network-emissions\"><strong id=\"\">Emission rewards</strong></a> are credited to the staked pool within each <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-component\"><strong id=\"\">validator component</strong></a> automatically by the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-radix-protocol\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Protocol </strong></a>at the end of every <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/whats-an-epoch-2\"><strong id=\"\">epoch</strong></a>. The <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-liquid-stake-unit-lsu-and-native-liquid-staking\"><strong id=\"\">Liquid Stake Units (LSUs)</strong></a> that represent a proportional claim on the XRD in that pool can therefore claim slightly more XRD with the passing of each epoch.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">As per the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/categories/radix-tokens-tokenomics\"><strong id=\"\">Radix Economic model</strong></a>, approximately 300m XRD will be emitted per year for 40 years after network genesis.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Further reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/start-here-radix-tokens-and-tokenomics\"><strong id=\"\">Start Here! Radix Tokens and Tokenomics</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-do-xrd-emissions-work\"><strong id=\"\">How do XRD emissions work?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-long-is-an-epoch-on-radix-2\"><strong id=\"\">How long is an epoch on Radix?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-xrd-staking-emissions-rewards-penalties-are-calculated-general\"><strong id=\"\">How XRD staking emissions rewards are calculated - general</strong></a></li></ul><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\"><br></p>",
